      },
      "message": "build(kernel): bump solidcore to the synced fork rev fa67b3f5\n\nThe fork NeoTech/solidcore main was fast-forwarded to upstream\ntangency-labs/solidcore main (300 commits, 2016386 -> fa67b3f5).\nPin all six solidcore crates at the full new rev and update\nCargo.lock for them only. No new package; solidcore-ops moves serde\nfrom a dev-dependency to a dependency (serde is already in the lock).\n\nRemove the unused workspace line truck-polymesh (#3742); it stays\nin Cargo.lock through truck-meshalgo.\n\nUpdate the solidcore rev in assets/ui/LICENSES.md (NOTICE and\nLICENSE blobs are unchanged).\n\nFixes #3767\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
